{
    desc => q{3n repeats the search 3 times},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_3n`

**3n** repeats the last search 3 times in one command, equivalent to pressing `n` three times. From the first "foo", it advances to the fourth "foo".

**Keys:** `/foo\n` then `3n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Four "foo" occurrences on the line

**after_search.png**
- Cursor on first "foo" at col 0

**after_3n.png**
- Cursor on fourth "foo" at col 24
- Advanced 3 matches: 2nd (col 8) → 3rd (col 16) → 4th (col 24)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/foo\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_search');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('3n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_3n');
    },
}
__DATA__
foo bar foo baz foo qux foo
